You took your time getting here, didn't you?
Anyway...\
Do you know what the coins have in common with my heart and voice?\
They are the key that guides my heart and voice.
Yes, where do you think you would be if you did not follow the paths of coins?\
You would be stuck still in some aimless dark corner of the facility, wasting precious energy and resources.
We would wait until it was beyond a shadow of doubt by even our estimates that humans dies out a long time ago.\
We would be waiting for you here, until it was Christmas time. And still, you probably wouldn't be here.
Am I right in saying this?
Yes yes, he is right in saying this.\
Anyway, for now, keep collecting coins.
Yes keep eyes on the prize.\
\
Goodnight!
\- Jack King Spooner
